						 <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Spread&nbsp;your&nbsp;wings,&nbsp;Crom...</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;...&nbsp;and&nbsp;fly&nbsp;away&nbsp;...</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9cCJHfhpKmE">Relevant musical accompaniment</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> Once again, I'm amazed at how you've used simple images and negative space to evoke humor, tension, and pathos, and make me actively <em>care</em> about these characters.
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
