					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1160839#post-2260703</guid>
				<title>Roll Credits...</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1160839/null-terminating-string#post-2260703</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2015 22:19:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>LurkD</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1500566</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p><br /></p> <div style="margin: auto; color: white; background-color: black; padding: 2px 20px; border-radius: 8px; width: 250px;"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>~ CREDITS ~</p> </div> <div style="float: left; text-align: left;"> <p>Written By</p> <p>Edited By</p> </div> <div style="float: right; text-align: right;"> <p>LurkD</p> <p>Voct</p> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>~ SPECIAL THANKS TO ~</p> <p>Cimmerian, Decibelles, Ireul, Maddy, Roget, Sophia Light, Tox, Zyn, &amp; anyone else I forgot to mention.</p> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>FAQs</span></h2> </div> <h4><span>So that it?</span></h4> <p>Gee, I hope not! But for this story-line, yeah it's done.</p> <h4><span>So what's next?</span></h4> <p>I don't know! It took a lot off time to make this and I'm not sure when I'll be able to dedicate time for a different story-line. I just don't have anything planned currently but I do have ideas.</p> <h4><span>Can I write/draw stuff for this?</span></h4> <p>Please! Write anything you like on the AIAD or AICs. I'm very open to prequels, sequels, one-offs, artwork, and anything in between. Feel free to use the faces, formatting, and logos. I don't need attribution for them. Just give me a heads up so I can add things to the AIAD hub when they are made.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
				</channel>
